  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A retractable brow pencil that features an innovative blade tip for precise, hair-like detail and dimension and a spoolie for effortless blending. <br><b><br>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, mineral oil, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The blade’s slanted edge offers broad strokes for outlining, defining, and shading, while the automatic slide-up pencil delivers the perfect amount of product. The emollient-infused formula offers precision glide, and eight shades offer an even, natural matte finish that complements any hair color.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Choose the shade that best resembles your natural brow color.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Synthetic Beeswax, Dicalcium Phosphate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Cera [Cera Carnauba], Mica, Sorbitan Tristearate, Panthenol, Tocopherol, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A retractable brow pencil that features an innovative blade tip for precise, hair-like detail and dimension and a spoolie for effortless blending. <br><b><br>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, mineral oil, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The blade’s slanted edge offers broad strokes for outlining, defining, and shading, while the automatic slide-up pencil delivers the perfect amount of product. The emollient-infused formula offers precision glide, and eight shades offer an even, natural matte finish that complements any hair color.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Choose the shade that best resembles your natural brow color.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Synthetic Beeswax, Dicalcium Phosphate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Cera [Cera Carnauba], Mica, Sorbitan Tristearate, Panthenol, Tocopherol, May Contain/Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090).</div></details>",
